    h1 Gun Violence
    .source_info


    section.source_section
        h2 Gun Violence
        markdown
        .source_example
            | !{data.header}
            main.pol-theme.content
                .container.gun-violence.page-top-margin
                    .col-lg-9.col-md-8
                        .yellow-note
                            | In response to recent national events involving gun violence, American Psychiatric Association Publishing has collected resources relating to gun violence and mental health to help dispel the myths that the two issues are closely linked.


                        h5.font-weight-light.border-bottom NEWS
                        .slider__container
                          | !{data.MainSlides}

                        h5.font-weight-light.border-bottom In the News
                        .pol-theme
                            .theme-note
                                div
                                    | Dr. Gold appears on the Diane Rehm show discussing the reaction to the Orlando shootings.
                                    a.link(href="#" title="Listen Here")
                                        | Listen Here
                                div
                                    | Dr. Liza Gold continues to be a thought leader on the issue of Gun Violence and Mental Health.
                                    a.link(href="#" title="Read more")
                                        | Read more
                                div
                                    | Stop blaming mental health for gun violence. The problem is guns. by Dr. Kimberly Yonkers.
                                    a.link(href="#" title="Read more")
                                        | Read more

                        h5.font-weight-light.border-bottom Featured
                        .pol-theme
                            .theme-note
                                div
                                    | Explore complimentary chapters from the following highly commended American Psychiatric Association Publishing books.
                                div
                                    | Gun Violence and Mental Illness:
                                    a.link(href="#" title="Mass Shootings and Mental Illness")
                                        | Mass Shootings and Mental Illness
                                div
                                    | Disaster Psychiatry: Readiness, Evaluation, and Treatment:
                                    a.link(href="#" title="Grief and Resilience")
